id: VS-08
name: Risk Reporting and Decision Support
short_description: Provide coherent, decision-focused reporting and an audit-ready
  record of risk decisions and actions.
owner: null
stakeholders:
- Board/ExCo, Risk Committee, Regulators/customers (as needed), Business Leaders
triggers:
- Governance cadence, regulatory/customer requests, major incidents, portfolio changes.
inputs:
- Portfolio data (VS-02, VS-07), decision ledger (VS-04, VS-00), evidence (VS-06),
  incidents (VS-09), treatments (VS-05).
entry_criteria: ''
key_activities:
- 1) Standardise narrative and decision asks
- 2) Produce portfolio views and trends
- 3) Build decision packs with options and trade-offs
- 4) Generate external assurance artefacts
- 5) Provide traceability links
- 6) Capture decisions and actions
- 7) Validate “one version of truth”
- 8) Improve reporting based on feedback.
decisions_and_gates: []
outputs:
- Board packs, dashboards, external assurance artefacts, decision logs, traceability
  graphs.
exit_criteria: ''
metrics: 'Flow: pack production cycle time; time to answer stakeholder queries.<br>Performance:
  stakeholder satisfaction; % reporting automated; disputes rate.<br>Risk: decision
  latency reduction; unresolved top risks visibility.'
source_file: docs\value-architecture\value-streams\VS-08-risk-reporting-decision-support.md
last_updated: '2026-02-01T12:57:43.711510Z'
